        answer: "\u65F6\u95F4\u5730\u70B9\uFF1Alast Saturday, at the community centre\uFF1B\u4EBA\u7269\uFF1Amy classmates and I, an old gardener\uFF1B\u8D77\u56E0\uFF1Ahelp clean the small garden before winter\uFF1B\u7ECF\u8FC7\uFF1Awe picked up rubbish, cut dry branches, and planted twenty small trees\uFF1B\u7ED3\u679C\u611F\u53D7\uFF1Afinished in three hours, the garden looked new, I felt proud of our work\u3002",
