        answer: "(1) Mr(H\u2082O) = 1\xD72 + 16\xD71 = 18\u3002(2) m(H)\u2236m(O) = (1\xD72)\u2236(16\xD71) = 2\u223616 = 1\u22368\u3002(3) 36 g \xD7 (1\xD72)/18 = 36 g \xD7 2/18 = 4 g\uFF0C\u5373 36 g \u6C34\u4E2D\u542B\u6C22\u5143\u7D20 4 g\u3002",
